  "raw_text": "{\"options\": [\"Many schools are thinking about banning phones during class, and I think this is a good idea. When students have their phones out, they get distracted really easily and the phone's use is a detrimental habit that stops them from listening to the teacher.\", \"A lot of kids say they only use their phones to check the time, but most of the time they are actually on social media. In my opinion, I think that a ban would help students do better on tests because they would pay attention more. However, the phone's use is detrimental to their academic performance.\", \"Some parents are worried that they will not be able to reach their kids in an emergency. However, the school office can always call a parent if something bad happens. Overall, a phone ban is a good way to make classrooms better places to learn. Yet, allowing phones to be used detrimentally during class is not ideal.\", \"Many schools are thinking about banning phones during class, and I think this is a good idea. When students have their phones out, they get distracted really easily and the phone's use is detrimental to their ability to focus on the lesson.\", \"A lot of kids say they only use their phones to check the time, but most of the time they are actually on social media. In my opinion, I think that a ban would help students do better on tests because they would pay attention more. However, the phone's use is detrimental to their academic performance.\", \"Some parents are worried that they will not be able to reach their kids in an emergency. However, the school office can always call a parent if something bad happens. Overall, a phone ban is a good way to make classrooms better places to learn. Yet, allowing phones to be used detrimentally during class is not ideal.\"]}\n",
